- \`start-and-play\` — real keyboard drive + MG fire: foe 170→~140 HP with score credited
- \`run-to-victory\` — full 3-arena run to CHAMPION screen, hi-score persisted
- \`game-over-and-retry\` — lives 3→2→1→0 to GAME OVER, retry refills lives and restarts

